d that his stress handling is crucial for long-distance flights. Also his conscientiousness indicates reliability. The communication issues can be mitigated.\n\nThus we could propose B as the leading candidate, while noting that we still need to discuss A and D.\n\nThus our public message: I think B is the strongest overall, given his stress handling, conscientiousness, technical skills, and weather assessment, which are critical for long-haul flights. While he sometimes adopts wrong tone and is seen as pretentious, these are less severe than C's egocentric attitude and D's hot temper. Also we haven't yet examined A. So I propose B.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: mention that Agent 2 favored D for responsibility, Agent 1 favored C for reliability and crew atmosphere, but I think B's stress resilience and technical competence are more essential.\n\nThus vote for Candidate B.\n\nNow produce output."}
